\">[</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">]</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math> thì <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">[</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">]</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math>. <br>Dựa vào đồ thị, ta thấy hàm số đạt giá trị lớn nhất trên <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">[</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">]</mo></mrow></semantics></math> là <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>1</mn></semantics></math> và giá trị nhỏ nhất trên <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">[</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">]</mo></mrow></semantics></math> là <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></semantics></math>. <br>Vậy <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></semantics></math> và <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></semantics></math>, suy ra <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>m</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.</li></ol>",
